    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Weekly n8n Backup\n\nBerdasarkan template n8n.io \"Backup all n8n workflows to Google Drive\" — diadaptasi jadi mingguan + tambahan GitHub.\n\n1. Kredensial: n8n API (bikin di Settings > n8n API), Google Drive OAuth2, GitHub OAuth2\n2. Node \"Get All Workflows\" pakai node n8n native (bukan HTTP Request) supaya hasilnya definisi lengkap per workflow, bukan cuma ringkasan\n3. Folder Drive lama otomatis dihapus tiap run supaya gak numpuk\n4. Ganti owner/repository GitHub sesuai repo backup kamu\n5. Isi folderId \"Create New Folder\" & \"Get Old Folders\" ke folder khusus jika tidak mau di root Drive",
        "height": 624,
        "color": 5
      },
